						730210224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210224,
					"content": "Hmm... Speaking of which, Varuna Contraption has been much more stable lately, and the weather has become normal again...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210225,
					"content": "Actually, it was us...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210226,
					"content": "Hmph! I'm sure it was a good Nara like that Nara who repaired Varuna Contraption! It wasn't soup thieves like the two of you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210227,
					"content": "Hey, don't be so mean! It just smelled too good to resist...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210228,
					"content": "But if it's that difficult, why are you cooking here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210229,
					"content": "Hmph! The key to cooking must be collected every day, which is...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210230,
						730210231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210230,
					"content": "Your pride as a chef?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210232,
					"content": "Water! It's water! Water has a huge impact on the aroma of my soup. So it has to be made with the best water!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210233,
					"content": "I've been collecting water throughout Apam Woods to make soup with. After collecting water samples as numerous as the leaves on a tree, I finally found the best \"Living Spring.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210234,
					"content": "It's the only water source fit for Festival Utsava's supreme delicacy! You wouldn't get it even if I told you... Only that Nara from before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210235,
					"content": "Speaking of which, Arapacati sent us...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210236,
					"content": "You bring Arapas up to speed on the events so far...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210237
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210237,
					"content": "Ah, you're Nara friends of my sister! And Festival Utsava is coming!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210238,
					"content": "It's fine. I've found Living Spring, and my Supreme Delicacy is complete. It's in this pot... Oh, right...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210239,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210240,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210241,
					"content": "Eh-hehe... Don't be sad, at least your soup was really aromatic...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210242,
					"content": "Ah! My Living Spring! \"Apshvaana\" live at its source. I waited so long for them to leave and only collected a pot of it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210243,
					"content": "No! You must get me another pot of Living Spring!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210244,
					"content": "\"Apshvaana\"? What's that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210245,
					"content": "Hmph! You Nara really know nothing about the forest. They live in the water, and they have four legs, a tail, and they bite.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210246,
					"content": "...Dogs?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210247,
						730210248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210247,
					"content": "Dogs don't live in the water.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210249
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210249,
					"content": "Ah, right. Then what's an \"Apshvaana\"?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210250,
					"content": "Forget that! I want my water! And I want Living Spring from there in particular!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210251,
					"content": "#Alright, alright... {NICKNAME}, we don't have a choice here. Let's go...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210252,
						730210253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210252,
					"content": "Right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210254
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210254,
					"content": "It must be Living Spring and no other!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210253,
					"content": "Let's go.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210254
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210248,
					"content": "Perhaps Oceanid Dogs?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210249
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210231,
					"content": "The will to never forget your dreams?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210220,
					"content": "It... It was Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210221,
					"content": "#Hey! {NICKNAME}, how could you betray Paimon like that!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210222,
					"content": "I don't care who drank it! My soup is gone!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arapas"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210208,
					"content": "We shouldn't...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210209,
					"content": "Paimon is just so curious. Uh, Paimon will just take one mouthful, just one!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210210,
					"content": "What if you get a tummy ache after?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210211,
					"content": "Hmph! Don't you underestimate Paimon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302103,
